Z||000000||OilStumped||05-01-99||10:12 PM||||Evryone I talk to tries to tell me that Fiero's are bombs and blow up and stuff.  Its all a bunch of garbage.  First off...I found a site a while back with the 84's crash test ratings....and they were in the top 5.  And as for the blowing up part....that only happens when people don't take care of them and they start leaking oil and it gets on the exhaust and poof!  Yeah...mine leaks oil...but I make sure its clean under there.  I don't wanna lose my baby.  I love Fiero's, no matter what anyone tries to tell me.  If I thke them for a ride, they always get out of the car with a totally different attitude...haha...Peace!
